### Sales report - default current year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/sales/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by customer and category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales/?customer=1&category=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by payment status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales/?status=paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly chart for 2025
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales/?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales/?page=2&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export filtered report to CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/sales/?date_from=2026-01-01&export=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
